PERSONAL USE
Personal, non-commercial use is donationware. You may download and use the font files from this repository for personal projects. A donation to the designer is appreciated and not required.

COMMERCIAL USE
Commercial use requires a license from Max Infeld:
- US$95 per typeface, for one licensee
- US$65,000 for every typeface in the catalog, for one licensee
Write to maxinfeld@gmail.com or use the catalog at https://fonts.grok.me.

A commercial license grants unlimited commercial use of the licensed typeface(s) in the licensee's own work, including embedding in documents, websites, applications, video, and merchandise, without further royalty.

You may not resell, redistribute, sublicense, or share the font files themselves.
You may not modify the typefaces or create derivative fonts without prior written permission from Max Infeld.

The grant is personal to one licensee (one human or one agent) and is not transferable.
